{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkdn5qv8cbpow9ZGxVwn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll tell my son: I still don't know how much money there would be. The page never gave me a sum in shekels, so I'll ask him or the HR person at the new job. As for when, I'm fairly sure of it. It says \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך\" with no tax, and \"למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים\". At 67 that's me, so about three years after the first deposit.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **Screen 1.** The title \"קרן השתלמות\". The heading under it says saving through work that you can take out without tax after a set time, so it looked like it was for me. Under \"מה זה\" I read that the employer puts in money every month and so do I. Then the 6 years, and the 3 years for people at retirement age.\n2. **Screen 2.** The top lines were hidden behind the bar with the buttons. I could only make out pale bits of a percentage, maybe \"7.5%\". I saw \"15,712 ₪\" and \"20,566 ₪ בשנה\", but those were for self-employed people, so not me. Then a box that said exactly what I wanted to know, \"כמה כסף נשאר לכם, ומתי?\", but there was only a \"הציגו את החישוב\" link under it and no sum.\n3. **Screens 3 and 4.** I read \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע\". I recognised הראל and אלטשולר שחם, which was reassuring. Under \"משיכה ומעבר\" it says the money reaches me within \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\".\n4. **Screens 5 and 6.** Moving money to another fund, then \"כמה זה עולה\". I saw \"עד 2% בשנה\" for management, \"דמי יציאה: לא גובים\", and that people actually paid \"0.34% עד 0.74%\". After that I stopped.\n\n**What I skipped:** The bubbles \"מדד S&P 500\", \"מזומן שקלי\" and \"מסלול כללי\". I skipped the little tags \"KH-19\" and \"PF-18\", the \"חוקים וכללים\" buttons, \"כל החברות\", and the link \"כמה העמלות האלה עולות לאורך זמן\". I didn't read screens 7 to 11.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"מסלול שעוקב אחרי מדדים\", because to me מדד is prices on the news. The English letters S&P, KH, PF. \"מס רווחי הון\". The dotted line under 123. \"131 המסלולים\", 131 of what?\n\n**What I'd change:** Put the sum for an ordinary salary right there in the box, with no extra link. Don't let the bar with the buttons cover the text. Make the grey lines darker. It's light text on a black background, which tires the eyes. Take the English letters out of the first screens.\n\n**Where I got tired:** By screen 6 there were percentages everywhere and I'd had enough."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3690,"cache_read_input_tokens":11563,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3690},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"11169cf3-ebec-43f8-8abd-dffc2f9b2aea","uuid":"20c78724-aafc-4dde-8ace-5b5799522551","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:17:54.208Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkdn5bmWg6ZwqwRH8jfb"}
